  "reply": "To change a patient’s preferred pharmacy, open **Patients > Chart > Demographics**, choose the **Pharmacy** tab, click **Search Directory**, find the pharmacy by name, NPI or zip code, select it and click **Set as Preferred**. To add a new local pharmacy, click **Add Custom Pharmacy**, fill in Name, Address, Phone and Fax, then click **Save Entry**. Only Medical Assistant or Provider users can make these changes."
}
